## IBM Bob 2.0 Contribution

IBM Bob 2.0 was used in Agent mode to design and implement FixFlow’s static application structure, interactive bug-report workflow, responsive interface, sample analysis flows, and project documentation. The work was completed as a focused agent task to keep the prototype small, testable, and easy to demonstrate. The IBM Bob task session summary is included in the `evidence/` folder.

